# Deterministic line endings on every platform.
#
# tests/audit-article-hash.test.mjs extracts the vendored scorer's
# normalizeMarkdown from its source bytes; a core.autocrlf=true
# checkout (Windows default) must not smudge what tests read. Pin
# every text type we ship to LF so a checkout is byte-identical to
# the repo. (The test also tolerates an already-smudged working
# tree — this file keeps fresh clones clean.)
*.js    text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
*.ts    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.png   binary
